8. She has a low BMI, which she acknowledges is in the unhealthy range ("in the red on the low scale"). (Verbatim: "my BMI yeah um it's um it's it's bad... it's definitely in the red um... on the low scale")

9. She finds poetry difficult and was not good at it in school. (Verbatim: "i wasn't very good at poetry back in school um poetry is difficult difficult lemon difficult")

10. She often gives off the impression of being shorter than she actually is, despite being taller than many people she meets in person. (Verbatim: "most people that meet me irl think i'm shorter... it's happened with at least like 10 different people so i don't know what how i give off such a short aura") [end of text]



1. She grew up with two cats, one unfriendly to others and one very friendly. (Verbatim: "two i only had two growing up... one cat was bringing in like finish the job sparrows and mice the other cat was like here's a leaf this is my leaf i got you a leaf")

